---@field memberPriceEffectiveInterval? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_inventories_v1.Interval A date range during which the item is eligible for member price. If not specified, the member price is always applicable. The date range is represented by a pair of ISO 8601 dates separated by a space, comma, or slash.
---@field tierLabel? string The label of the tier within the loyalty program. Must match one of the labels within the program.
---@field loyaltyPoints? string The amount of loyalty points earned on a purchase.

